OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fand cloudy, though there may be some
OL,7,Fshowers at times. The strong winds
OL,8,Fwill ease slightly through the
OL,9,Fevening, though strong gusts will
OL,10,Fstill be possible, especially along
OL,11,Fthe coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FGenerally fine and dry with
OL,14,Fsunny spells, though the odd shower
OL,15,Fcan't be ruled out. Winds easing
OL,16,Ffurther to become light by the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
